<p>This canvas is color only. The server turns down anything with a character in it, so you cannot write text here. Draw something instead.</p>
<p>Your cooldown is tied to your SSH key, so reconnecting will not reset it. This page only reads the canvas. It changes over SSH and nowhere else.</p>





