                <h3>Guidelines and Selection Criteria:</h3>
<div>
	<ul>
		<li>Both professional and amateur artists are permitted to enter.</li>
		<li>Must be a resident of Ohio.</li>
		<li>Must be 18 years old.</li>
		<li>One entry per person.</li>
		<li>Artwork must be family friendly.</li>
		<li>In effort to help celebrate America's 250th anniversary, it is recommended that artwork include a patriotic theme, whether that is using colors of the American flag or celebrating Ohio's heritage and America 250 in some way.</li>
