		<li>Size guidelines 24 inches x 36 inches/2:3 aspect ratio. Portrait orientation required.</li>
		<li>Must be able to be reproduced and must be scalable to standard poster or postcard size.</li>
		<li>All entries must be submitted electronically. Submissions must be high-quality digital photographs or images of your poster. .JPGs and .PDFs are acceptable.</li>
