<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article itemprop="text">
<p dir="auto">Userspace <strong>macOS ARM64 → Linux aarch64</strong> translation layer (CLI-first, no JIT).</p>
<p dir="auto">Load Darwin Mach-O on Linux aarch64, map a freestanding <code>libSystem</code>, translate
BSD syscalls, and run real guests (clang probes, <strong>7-Zip <code>7zz</code></strong>, <strong>curl</strong>,
threads).</p>
