</tr>
<tr>
<td>Dry-load / inspect</td>
<td>Any host (including macOS)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Design reference</td>
<td><a href="https://github.com/wie-project/kakehashi/blob/main/docs/README.md"><code>docs/</code></a></td>
