<p dir="auto">Harmless noise on many runs:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code>kh: open fail ENOENT(openat) path=/etc/ssl/openssl.cnf</code> — OpenSSL optional config; HTTP/HTTPS still work via the seeded CA bundle.</li>
<li><code>WARN … skip dylib … Security/CoreFoundation</code> — Apple frameworks not in the bottle; soft stubs cover the load path.</li>
<li><code>unresolved strong symbol; bound to named missing trampoline</code> — symbols not hit on the happy path.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Details and gates: <a href="https://github.com/wie-project/kakehashi/blob/main/docs/curl.md"><code>docs/curl.md</code></a>.</p>
